{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Journal Lane 是一款把日記直接寫入私人日曆的記事工具，適合希望用 Apple 或 Google 日曆保存每日文字與照片、又不想被特定 App 鎖住資料的使用者；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-141.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>日曆內私人日記</h2>\n<p>日記以獨立日曆的全天事件儲存，照片以日期命名放在自己的雲端硬碟，轉換裝置仍可延續；可逐日書寫、加入照片、搜尋舊文及匯出 Markdown，亦提供今天頁面小工具與舊日回顧，所有內容只留在使用者自己的 Apple 或 Google 帳戶。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-28.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-29.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-30.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-31.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-32.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-33.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Journal Lane: Calendar Diary</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/journal-lane-calendar-diary/id6826183600?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.311916+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":298,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T21:48:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T23:22:10.378256+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:04.965137+00:00","content_hash":"90d7677d9227b4ac82bd75778a4dba7828a2d884af574cab0596bd82a78a105a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.311916+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}